      "text": "Before you count the team, Atomy's U S plan has a personal P V gate.",
      "shot": "A large PERSONAL PV key moves toward a locked gate on a green stage. Per-word reveal (dynamic-content-sequencing); title BEFORE THE TEAM then key then gate arrive sequentially. Ground grid, gate midground, key foreground."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.345,
      "end": 10.233,
      "text": "It says you must first accumulate ten thousand personal P V before generating any downline P V.",
      "shot": "Gate counter builds to 10,000 via stat-bars-and-fills, then lock slides off and gate opens. A DOWNLINE PV track is revealed only after ten thousand is spoken. One continuous diagram, upper-third title, center hero."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.333,
      "end": 16.84,
      "text": "That is an entry condition, not an automatic payday. Other qualification and commission rules still apply.",
      "shot": "The open gate exposes two separate tracks: DOWNLINE PV proceeds; PAYOUT remains behind a RULES lock. Smooth scale-swap-transition to a closer view and progressive disclosure on entry condition, payday, then rules. Never depict guaranteed money."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.94,
      "end": 23.66,
      "text": "Think gate open, not money guaranteed. Read your local plan before buying for a threshold. Save the distinction.",
      "shot": "Pull the gate motif into an inverted card: GATE OPEN ≠ PAYDAY. RECHECK LOCAL PLAN follows on its spoken cue; yellow SAVE tab presses once. Sequential reveal (dynamic-content-sequencing), final still hold and no critical content below caption band."
    }
